hat we are planning for.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/alaska-air-group-inc-alk-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ben Minicucci","x":"Load factors then improved to 52% for June due to both returning passenger demand and actions we took to rightsize our capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"Today, I'll provide an update on both areas as well as share initial thoughts on restructuring Alaska for the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q3","e":"alk","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brad Tilden","x":"Sixth, our finance team has led our work to rightsize our operation and reduce spending, and we've reduced our cash burn from approximately $13 million per day to $4 million per day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q3","e":"alk","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brad Tilden","x":"As I mentioned, over 4,000 employees volunteered for programs that were designed to reduce our need to furlough as we rightsize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"We removed $2.4 billion in expenses in 2020, shrunk capital spending and moved to secure structural cost savings going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/alaska-air-group-alk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2020 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2021-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"The -- I think you're speaking to the structural cost savings when you're talking about the $215 million or $235 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/alaska-air-group-alk-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2021 Q1","e":"alk","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"Areas of particular strength included our overhead spend, productivity in our airport ramp and aircraft mechanic groups, further progress against long-term structural cost savings and regional flying unit costs, which were nearly flat year over two, with especially solid cost performance at Horizon.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/23/alaska-air-group-alk-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2021 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Harrison","x":"And yes, some of them were there pre-pandemic that was ready, but there's also been big changes in our business like corporate contracts, TMC, American, oneworld, merchandising, and we've got some network restructuring and changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2021 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"But I think our view is by the middle of next year with sort of the full ramp of our cost restructuring initiatives, we're going to be in a really good place.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2021 Q3","e":"alk","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"Our cost restructuring targets are intact, and this quarter's results reflect realization of productivity savings, as well as the efficiencies of now seven, 737-9 aircraft flying for our mainline fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2021 Q3","e":"alk","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"As we do this, we will be continuing to deliver on our cost restructuring and fleet transition and unlocking commercial levers to drive additional value to our bottom line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/22/alaska-air-group-alk-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2022 Q1","e":"alk","d":"2022-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ben Minicucci","x":"We have accelerated our move to single fleet to drive cost savings and operational efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/21/alaska-air-group-alk-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2022 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2022-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ben Minicucci","x":"The strategic steps we've taken, streamlining our business, moving to a single fleet and capitalizing on commercial opportunities are set to make Air Group a stronger company, positioning us well in any environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/21/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2022 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2022-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ben Minicucci","x":"But as I also have shared in our prepared remarks, we are very excited about the restructuring of our distribution channels for business, with Amex GBT as well as joint contracting with American Airlines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/21/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2022 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2023-01-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"So, there's not -- even though you have these headlines of layoffs, it doesn't really mean that there's like another downward step in terms of their travel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/26/alaska-air-group-alk-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2023 Q3","e":"alk","d":"2023-10-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andrew Harrison","x":"Yeah, I think it was like at the beginning of September, I think we had reiterated our guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/19/alaska-air-group-alk-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2023 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2024-01-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"We didn't -- we haven't managed any cost out of the system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/25/alaska-air-group-alk-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2023 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2024-01-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"So, there's more net cost headwind in the quarter, and we didn't take any other cost out of the business because obviously, it happened January 5th, and there was no time to react.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/25/alaska-air-group-alk-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2024 Q1","e":"alk","d":"2024-04-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane Tackett","x":"The full value of hedging cost reduction will take several quarters to bleed in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/18/alaska-air-group-alk-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2024 Q2","e":"alk","d":"2024-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shane R. Tackett","x":"While this will be a future opportunity in tailwind, as we continue to right-size our cost structure at these new growth levels, it's driving a headwind in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/18/alaska-air-group-alk-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ALK 2024 Q4","e":"alk","d":"2025-01-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Wadewitz","x":"But I'm wondering why you didn't -- where you chose not to raise the 2025 guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcrip